            "type": "text",
            "data": {
              "text": "AI-generated images can look real even when they are fake. Before sharing AI images, creators should think about:\n\n- whether the image could fool people\n- whether it spreads stereotypes or harmful ideas\n- whether people would know the image was made with AI",
