          {
            "id": "20ea165d-fc86-44fb-86ca-97e075ddaf01",
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
              "text": "When to Use AI\n\n- The chatbot helps brainstorm ideas quickly\n- The suggestions help the creator get started\n- The chatbot encourages adding personal ideas and reactions\n\n\n\n\nWhy You Might Not\n- Some ideas might sound too similar to videos that already exist\n- AI could still create misleading titles or fake information\n- The creator still has to decide what is actually good to post",
              "textAlign": "left",
              "locked": true
            },
            "position": {
              "x": 1455.36539147251,
              "y": 1630.3974705947492
            },
            "measured": {
              "width": 408,
