            "dragging": false
          },
          {
            "id": "f5589d39-a81c-4c92-8280-e86551214b3b",
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
              "text": "✅  Double-Check Before Posting\nAI can make mistakes or create fake information, even when it sounds confident.\n\n🔐  Protect Your Audience’s Trust\nCreators should think carefully before posting AI-generated content that could confuse or mislead people.\n\n💡  Use AI to Help — Not Replace Your Ideas\nAI is best for brainstorming and support, not for replacing human creativity and judgment.\n\n🤔  Think About the Impact\nEven funny AI-generated content can hurt people or spread misinformation if it’s used irresponsibly.",
              "textAlign": "left",
              "fontSize": "large",
              "locked": true
            },
